<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian 10-year bond remains at lofty level.</title>
<headline>Australian 10-year bond remains at lofty level.</headline>
<text>
<p>----------(Snapshot at 8.55 A.M./2255 GMT)------------------</p>
<p>FUTURES					  CASH YIELD</p>
<p>90-DAY BILLS  (SEP) 95.08  (+ 0.01)    4.94    (UNCH)</p>
<p>3-YR T-BONDS  (SEP) 94.34  (+ 0.02)    5.50    (- 0.03)</p>
<p>10-YR T-BONDS (SEP) 93.660 (+0.040)    6.36    (- 0.04)</p>
<p>AUD/USD  0.7452 (PREV 0.7433) US 30-YR  6.30   (- 0.03)</p>
<p>---------------------(Aug 1)--------------------------------</p>
<p>*Australian 10-year bond futures remained at their recent lofty level, notching up another all-time high of 93.680 in after hours trading, and supported by resilient U.S. Treausries.</p>
<p>*Likely caution ahead of U.S. payrolls later on Friday,</p>
